Key Takeaway

Azure provides multiple technologies to improve virtual machine availability and scalability. Availability Sets protect against hardware and maintenance failures, Availability Zones protect against datacenter outages, and Virtual Machine Scale Sets with Autoscale enable applications to grow and shrink automatically based on demand. Understanding these availability and scaling solutions is essential for building resilient cloud architectures and is a major focus area of the AZ-104 exam.
